# Defence-in-depth guard for the root `xessa` name-reservation tarball.
# `package.json` `files` is the authoritative allowlist; npm ignores this file
# while `files` exists. Keep this list current so a tarball stays minimal if
# `files` is ever removed by mistake. Never ignore README.md, LICENSE, bin/ or
# package.json.

# Dependencies and workspace packages
node_modules/
packages/

# Source, tests and examples
tests/
examples/
scripts/
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Documentation and tooling
docs/
.ai/
.github/
.vscode-test/

# Build, release and archive artifacts
*.vsix
*.tgz
package-lock.json
bun.lock
*.log

# Editor, OS and local configuration
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
AGENTS.md
opencode.jsonc
biome.json
tsconfig*.json
SPECIFICATION.md
CHANGELOG.md
.git*
